---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Shanghai Travel Guide: The Most Foreigner-Friendly City";
const description = "Shanghai guide — attractions, food, transport, and where to stay in China's most international city.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏙️ 上海</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">上海旅游指南：最对外友好的城市</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">上海指南——景点、美食、交通，以及在中国最国际化的城市住宿。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读7分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-50 to-amber-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-900 mb-4">⚡ 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-yellow-800 leading-relaxed">Shanghai is <strong>中国最对外友好的城市</strong>它拥有世界上最大的英语人口、最多的国际餐厅和可与世界上任何城市相媲美的天际线。如果你对语言障碍或文化冲击感到紧张，上海是中国最温和的介绍。</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#why-visit" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🌆 为什么要去上海？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-many-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📅 你需要多少天？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#attractions" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎯 热门景点</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 出行</a></li>
        <li><a href="#where-to-stay" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏨 住在哪里</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-to-eat" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍜 吃什么</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="why-visit" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🌆 为什么要去上海？</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">上海感觉就像一个未来的城市。浦东的天际线——东方明珠塔和上海中心大厦穿透云层——是现代中国的面孔。但老城区仍然有魅力：法租界绿树成荫的街道、外滩的装饰艺术建筑和老城区蜿蜒的小巷。上海也是美食爱好者的天堂，有一些亚洲最好的美食，还有街头小摊，供应汤包，这将改变你的生活。</p>

    <h2 id="how-many-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">📅 你需要多少天？</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>3天（标准）：</strong> The Bund, Old Town, French Concession, and a skyline visit</li>
      <li><strong>4-5天（舒适）：</strong> Add Disneyland, Zhujiajiao Water Town, or a two-day trip to Suzhou</li>
      <li><strong>5+天（深潜）：</strong> Explore the city's museums, art galleries, and nightlife neighborhoods in depth</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="attractions" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🎯 热门景点</h2>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">外滩</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">上海标志性的海滨长廊一边是殖民时代的建筑，另一边是浦东的摩天大楼。最好在日落时分，当灯光亮起时参观。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">上海中心大厦</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">中国最高的建筑，世界第三高的建筑。546米的观景台可以俯瞰整个上海。乘坐电梯本身就是一种体验——速度可达20米/秒。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Yu Garden (豫园)</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">一座有400年历史的明代花园，隐藏在老城区的中心。周围环绕着豫园集市，一个充满活力的市场区，到处都是小吃和纪念品。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">法租界</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">曾经是法国殖民地，现在是上海最时髦的地区。武康路和安福路非常适合逛咖啡馆、精品店和看人。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">朱家角水乡</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">一个距离上海市中心仅45分钟路程的古老水乡。运河、石桥和明代建筑。半天的旅行，感觉远离城市摩天大楼的世界。</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🚇 出行</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>地铁：</strong> Shanghai has the longest metro system in the world (19 lines, 800+ km). Everything is labeled in English. Check the <a href="/zh/transport/metro-bus/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">中国主要城市地铁和公交指南</a> for route tips.</li>
      <li><strong>迪迪：</strong> Works perfectly. Use it for short trips or when the subway doesn't go there. Get setup tips in <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">外国人如何在中国使用滴滴</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>磁悬浮列车：</strong> The world's fastest commercial train, connecting Pudong Airport to downtown (7 minutes, 430 km/h). Worth doing for the experience.</li>
      <li><strong>骑自行车：</strong> Shanghai is flat and bike-friendly. Shared bikes are everywhere in the city center.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="where-to-stay" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🏨 住在哪里</h2>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">外滩/陆家嘴——最适合首次到访的游客</h3><p class="text-gray-700">标志性的景色，靠近主要景点，有很多豪华酒店。价格更贵，但值得挥霍。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">法租界——最适合美食家和文化爱好者</h3><p class="text-gray-700">最时尚的地区，有很棒的餐厅、酒吧和精品店。安静的街道两旁种着梧桐树。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">静安——最适合购物和夜生活</h3><p class="text-gray-700">一个充满活力的商业区，拥有良好的地铁连接。靠近南京路和静安寺。</p></div>

    <h2 id="what-to-eat" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🍜 吃什么</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>小龙包</strong> — Soup dumplings filled with pork and broth that explode in your mouth. The ultimate Shanghai food experience.</li>
      <li><strong>盛建宝</strong> — Pan-fried pork buns with a crispy bottom and juicy filling.</li>
      <li><strong>红烧肉--红烧肉</strong> — Pork belly slow-cooked in soy sauce and sugar until melt-in-your-mouth tender.</li>
      <li><strong>葱油面--丛油面</strong> — Simple but addictive noodles in scallion-infused oil.</li>
      <li><strong>螃蟹--大闸蟹</strong> — In autumn, hairy crabs from nearby Yangcheng Lake are a Shanghai obsession.</li>
      <li><strong>老上海奶茶</strong> — A nostalgic powdered milk-and-tea drink locals grew up with.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="not-prose mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a href="/zh/cities/city-select/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🗺️ <strong>在中国有多少天？</strong> — Plan your full itinerary</a>
        <a href="/zh/cities/beijing-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🏛️ <strong>国家移民局-区域免签证政策（海南30天）</strong> — See how Shanghai compares</a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/metro-bus/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚇 <strong>中国主要城市地铁和公交指南</strong> — Navigate Shanghai's subway</a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">💳 <strong>支付宝、微信支付以及一切与金钱有关的东西</strong> — Alipay and WeChat Pay setup</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>